You can create a resume using AI tools like ChatGPT. First, collect your details and give them to the AI tool.

### How to create a resume using AI tools

* Open ChatGPT.

* Ask AI to create a professional resume.

* Enter your personal details, education, skills, and career goal.

* AI will arrange your details in a professional resume format.

* Copy it into MS Word and save it as PDF.

### AI prompt for creating your resume

Act as a professional resume maker. Create a simple, attractive, and professional resume for a college student. Include my name, career objective, education, technical skills, strengths, hobbies, and personal details. Use clear English and a neat format suitable for a fresher.

### AI tools used for resume creation

* ChatGPT – Creates resume content and formats.

* Canva AI – Creates attractive resume designs.

* Microsoft Copilot – Helps write and improve resume content.

* Google Gemini – Generates resume summaries and career objectives.

